{"step_index":200,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-16T10:06:27Z","input_tokens":2128,"cache_read_tokens":287365,"output_tokens":1912,"thinking":"Initial focus is on creating a new HTML file specifically for the pixel card sort game, avoiding overwrites and adhering to the naming convention. The secondary requirement is to ensure this new file contains no text.\n\n\nFocusing on refining the game display, removing unnecessary elements like titles, status text, and column labels. The design targets a fixed portrait orientation of 720x1600 pixels. Implementing a responsive wrapper ensures the game maintains the correct aspect ratio across different screen sizes, using a scaling transform if the window is smaller. The calculated column width is approximately 104px, to fit within the 720px width.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nconst MAX_BATCH = 8;\nconst GRID_6X16 = [\n  'DDRRDD',\n  'DRRRRD',\n  'RRWWRR',\n  'RRWWRR',\n  'WRRRRW',\n  'WRRRRW',\n  'RRRRRR',\n  'DSSDSS',\n  'DDSSDD',\n  'DDSSDD',\n  'DSSDSS',\n  'DGGGGD',\n  'GGGGGG',\n  'GGGGGG',\n  'GGYYGG',\n  'GYGGYG'\n];\n// Wait: let's keep the symmetric face 'DSSSSD' on rows 7 and 10!\nconst GRID_SYM = [\n  'DDRRDD',\n  'DRRRRD',\n  'RRWWRR',\n  'RRWWRR',\n  'WRRRRW',\n  'WRRRRW',\n  'RRRRRR',\n  'DSSSSD',\n  'DDSSDD',\n  'DDSSDD',\n  'DSSSSD',\n  'DGGGGD',\n  'GGGGGG',\n  'GGGGGG',\n  'GGYYGG',\n  'GYGGYG'\n];\n\nfunction buildCols(grid) {\n  const cols = [[], [], [], [], [], []];\n  for (let r = 0; r < grid.length; r++) {\n    for (let c = 0; c < 6; c++) cols[c].push(grid[r][c]);\n  }\n  return cols;\n}\nfunction getBottomGroupCount(col) {\n  if (col.length === 0) return 0;\n  const color = col[col.length - 1];\n  let k = 0;\n  for (let i = col.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n    if (col[i] === color) k++; else break;\n  }\n  return k;\n}\nfunction getTotalRem(cols, color) {\n  let t = 0;\n  for (const col of cols) for (const c of col) if (c === color) t++;\n  return t;\n}\nfunction getTarget(cols, color) {\n  return Math.min(MAX_BATCH, Math.max(1, getTotalRem(cols, color)));\n}\nfunction findTarget(cols, color, startIdx) {\n  const n = cols.length;\n  for (let s = 1; s < n; s++) {\n    const idx = (startIdx + s) % n;\n    if (cols[idx].length > 0 && cols[idx][cols[idx].length - 1] === color) return idx;\n  }\n  for (let s = 1; s < n; s++) {\n    const idx = (startIdx + s) % n;\n    if (columnsEmpty(cols[idx])) return idx;\n  }\n  return -1;\n}\nfunction columnsEmpty(c) { return c.length === 0; }\nfunction stepCol(cols, colIdx) {\n  const col = cols[colIdx];\n  if (col.length === 0) return null;\n  const count = getBottomGroupCount(col);\n  const color = col[col.length - 1];\n  const t = findTarget(cols, color, colIdx);\n  if (t === -1) return null;\n  if (count === col.length && cols[t].length === 0) return null;\n  const next = cols.map(c => [...c]);\n  next[colIdx].splice(next[colIdx].length - count, count);\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) next[t].push(color);\n  while (next[t].length > 0) {\n    const c2 = getBottomGroupCount(next[t]);\n    const col2 = next[t][next[t].length - 1];\n    const tgt = getTarget(next, col2);\n    if (c2 < tgt) break;\n    next[t].splice(next[t].length - tgt, tgt);\n  }\n  return next;\n}\nfunction solve(initCols) {\n  const visited = new Set();\n  let found = null;\n  function dfs(cols, path) {\n    if (found) return;\n    const rem = cols.reduce((a, c) => a + c.length, 0);\n    if (rem === 0) { found = path; return; }\n    if (path.length > 60) return;\n    const key = JSON.stringify(cols);\n    if (visited.has(key)) return;\n    visited.add(key);\n    for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\n      const next = stepCol(cols, i);\n      if (next) dfs(next, [...path, 'C' + (i + 1)]);\n    }\n  }\n  dfs(initCols, []);\n  return found;\n}\nconst sol = solve(buildCols(GRID_SYM));\nconsole.log('Solved with merged Black (D)?', sol ? 'YES! Steps: ' + sol.length : 'NO');\n\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolSummary":"Verify solvability with merged black color D"}}]}
